Claude finished the response2026-09-28_claude_session-summary.md98 linesmdI'd like to resume development of an Rshiny App which serves as a user interface to the NPSdataverse suite of R packages and facilitates creating Ecological Metadata Langauge (EML) metadata for upload to DataStore, the National Park Service's digital science repository.Here is a .md file summarizing work to date.I've read through the session summary. This is a solid, detailed handoff — let me reflect back the state so we're aligned before diving in, since there's a lot of hard-won context here (especially the two EMLeditor bugs and the Tab 4 validation gap).
